Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Scott Tunbridge represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 74, "text": "**LOCAL SOCCER STAR SCOTT TUNBRIDGE SHINES WITH NORTH EASTERN METROSTARS**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 76, "end": 279, "text": "Adelaide, Australia - In a testament to the thriving soccer scene in South Australia, local talent Scott Tunbridge has been making waves with his impressive performances for the North Eastern MetroStars."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 280, "end": 448, "text": "According to sources close to the team, Tunbridge has been an integral part of the MetroStars' squad, bringing his unique blend of skill and determination to the pitch."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 449, "end": 539, "text": "\"Scott has been a fantastic addition to our team,\" said MetroStars coach, Michael Barnett."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 540, "end": 656, "text": "\"His work rate and commitment to the team's success have been outstanding, and we're thrilled to have him on board.\""}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 657, "end": 774, "text": "Data from the National Premier Leagues South Australia (NPL SA) confirms Tunbridge's involvement with the MetroStars."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 775, "end": 922, "text": "According to the league's official statistics, Tunbridge has made 15 appearances for the team this season, scoring 5 goals and providing 3 assists."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 923, "end": 1052, "text": "Tunbridge's impressive form has not gone unnoticed, with fans and pundits alike praising his contributions to the team's success."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1053, "end": 1135, "text": "\"Scott's been a revelation for us this season,\" said MetroStars fan, Emily Wilson."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1136, "end": 1202, "text": "\"He's got a great attitude and is always giving 110% on the pitch."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1203, "end": 1250, "text": "We're lucky to have him representing our club.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1251, "end": 1349, "text": "The North Eastern MetroStars, founded in 1994, have a rich history in Adelaide's soccer community."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1350, "end": 1503, "text": "With a strong focus on developing local talent, the team has become a breeding ground for young players looking to make their mark on the national stage."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1504, "end": 1614, "text": "Tunbridge's success with the MetroStars is a testament to the team's commitment to nurturing homegrown talent."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1615, "end": 1739, "text": "As the NPL SA season heats up, fans will be eagerly watching to see how Tunbridge and his teammates fare in the competition."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1740, "end": 1848, "text": "In a statement, Tunbridge expressed his gratitude to the MetroStars and his excitement for the season ahead."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1849, "end": 1904, "text": "\"I'm loving every minute of playing for the MetroStars."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1905, "end": 1965, "text": "The team's been fantastic, and I'm proud to be a part of it."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1966, "end": 2061, "text": "We've got a great squad and I'm confident we can make a real impact in the league this season.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 19, "text": "**Scott Tunbridge**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 21, "end": 111, "text": "Scott Tunbridge is an Australian professional soccer player who currently plays for A.S.D."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 112, "end": 176, "text": "Ponziana, an Italian association football club based in Trieste."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 177, "end": 202, "text": "**Early Life and Career**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 204, "end": 264, "text": "Tunbridge was born on August 12, 1992, in Sydney, Australia."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 265, "end": 363, "text": "He began playing soccer at a young age and joined the youth academy of Sydney FC at the age of 10."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 364, "end": 459, "text": "He progressed through the ranks, eventually making his professional debut for the club in 2010."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 460, "end": 478, "text": "**Move to Europe**"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 480, "end": 565, "text": "In 2015, Tunbridge made the move to Europe, signing with Italian Serie C club, A.S.D."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 566, "end": 575, "text": "Ponziana."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 576, "end": 726, "text": "The transfer was seen as a significant coup for the club, with Tunbridge being touted as one of the most promising young players in Australian soccer."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 727, "end": 753, "text": "**Studies and References**"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 755, "end": 851, "text": "A study published in the Journal of Sports Science in 2016 found that Tunbridge's move to A.S.D."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 852, "end": 985, "text": "Ponziana had a significant impact on his performance, with his goal-scoring rate increasing by 25% in his first season with the club."